  title="Celsius to Fahrenheit Converter — °C to °F | ComputeZap"
  description="Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit instantly. °F = (°C × 9/5) + 32. Free temperature converter. Body temp 37°C = 98.6°F. Boiling 100°C = 212°F."
  canonical="/celsius-to-fahrenheit"
  schema={schema}
>
